IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BPXMEOD.

*> Pix MED batch / end-of-day driver.  Orchestrates the existing MED
*> engine (BPXMED) over durable cases in deterministic key order:
*>   - expiry of past-deadline cases that still admit EXPIRE
*>   - re-drive of unknown / lost-outcome devolutions (retry path)
*>   - refresh of MED reconciliation status from persisted Pix state
*> It owns no state transitions and no financial logic: every mutation
*> goes through BPXMED, which locks the case, validates via BPXMEM and
*> audits.  Cases that cannot be safely operated (missing/orphaned
*> devolution links, devolutions that never posted, vanished case rows)
*> are NOT silently repaired: the batch records them as reconciliation
*> exceptions (BRECESO, type PIXMED, run id = batch request id) for
*> human follow-up and counts them in the control totals.
*> MB-SCOPE restricts the scan to cases whose claimant starts with it.
*>
*> Restart / idempotency: one durable run record per execution request id
*> (default MED-BATCH-<bizdate>, or MED-BATCH-<bizdate>-<scope>) stored in
*> var/data/pxmedb.idx.  A COMPLETED run replays as a no-op.  A RUNNING
*> run resumes from the persisted last-processed case id.  Per-case
*> outcomes are classified from persisted state, and the engine itself is
*> replay-safe (case locks, request-id idempotency, state machine), so an
*> interruption between mutation and checkpoint cannot duplicate any
*> financial effect.
*>
*> MB-OP: PROCESS (default) | DRY (inspection only: no writes at all,
*> including audit/events) | GET (read run record by MB-REQ-ID).
*> MB-SCOPE optionally restricts processing to case ids starting with it.
*> MB-FAULT-AFTER stops cleanly after N processed cases and leaves the run
*> RUNNING at its checkpoint: a deterministic interruption for restart
*> regression tests without killing the process (test hook only).

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT SCAN-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-SCAN-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS MC-CASE-ID OF SCAN-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-SCAN-ST.
    SELECT RUN-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-RUN-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS MBR-KEY OF RUN-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-RUN-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD SCAN-FILE.
01 SCAN-REC.
   COPY "BPXMC".
FD RUN-FILE.
01 RUN-REC.
   COPY "BPXMBR".

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
   COPY "BPXSTO".
   COPY "BPXMCSTO".
   COPY "BPXMCP".
   COPY "BKAUDP".
   COPY "BKEVTP".
   COPY "BRECP".
01 BK-PX-REC.
   COPY "BPX".
01 BK-PX-MC-REC.
   COPY "BPXMC".
01 WS-CFG.
   05 WS-HOME-CFG PIC X(80).
   05 WS-BIZDATE PIC 9(08).
   05 WS-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 WS-JRN-GEN PIC 9(09).
   05 WS-CFG-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-SCAN-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-RUN-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-SCAN-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-RUN-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-STOP PIC X(01).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).
01 WS-STATE PIC X(12).
01 WS-PREV PIC X(12).
01 WS-DEADLINE PIC 9(08).
01 WS-DEVOL-ID PIC X(12).
01 WS-DEV-POST PIC X(12).
01 WS-DEV-FOUND PIC X(01).
01 WS-DEV-STATE PIC X(12).
01 WS-DESIRED PIC X(12).
01 WS-RECON-CUR PIC X(12).
01 WS-WORK-OP PIC X(12).
01 WS-CLASS PIC X(14).
01 WS-ENG-RC PIC X(02).
01 WS-SCOPE PIC X(12).
01 WS-SCOPE-LEN PIC 9(02).
01 WS-PROCESSED PIC 9(07).
01 WS-SCAN-CNT PIC 9(07).
01 WS-ELIG-CASES PIC 9(07).
01 WS-ELIG-EXP PIC 9(07).
01 WS-ELIG-RCV PIC 9(07).
01 WS-ELIG-RCN PIC 9(07).
01 WS-EVT-TYPE PIC X(40).
01 WS-LOCK-NAME PIC X(24).
01 WS-LOCK-OWNER PIC X(16).
01 WS-LOCK-MODE PIC X(01).
01 WS-LOCK-ST PIC X(02).
01 BK-EXC-REC.
   COPY "BRECE".
01 WS-SEQ-NAME PIC X(20) VALUE "RECEXC".
01 WS-SEQ PIC 9(12).
01 WS-SEQ-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-ID-NUM PIC 9(11).
01 WS-ID-ED PIC X(11).
01 WS-INCONS PIC X(12).
01 WS-INCONS-PREV PIC X(12).
01 WS-INCONS-CNT PIC 9(07).
01 WS-EXC-CNT PIC 9(07).
01 WS-CLAIM-AMT PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-CLAIM-CUR PIC X(03).

LINKAGE SECTION.
   COPY "BPXMBP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-MED-BATCH.
    MOVE "00" TO MB-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO MB-MSG
    MOVE "N" TO MB-REPLAY
    MOVE "N" TO WS-STOP
    CALL "BCFG" USING WS-CFG
    IF WS-CFG-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
        MOVE "BUSINESS DATE UNAVAILABLE" TO MB-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO MB-BIZDATE
    IF MB-OPERATOR = SPACES
        MOVE "BATCH" TO MB-OPERATOR
    END-IF
    PERFORM BUILD-REQ-ID
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-SCAN-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/pxmed.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-SCAN-PATH
    END-STRING
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-RUN-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/pxmedb.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-RUN-PATH
    END-STRING
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(MB-SCOPE) TO WS-SCOPE
    COMPUTE WS-SCOPE-LEN = FUNCTION LENGTH(WS-SCOPE)
    IF FUNCTION TRIM(MB-OP) = "GET"
        PERFORM RUN-READ
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF FUNCTION TRIM(MB-OP) = "DRY"
        PERFORM SCAN-PASS
        IF MB-RC NOT = "00"
            GOBACK
        END-IF
        MOVE WS-SCAN-CNT TO MB-SCANNED
        MOVE WS-ELIG-CASES TO MB-ELIGIBLE
        MOVE WS-ELIG-EXP TO MB-EXPIRE-ELIG
        MOVE WS-ELIG-RCV TO MB-RECOVER-ELIG
        MOVE WS-ELIG-RCN TO MB-RECON-ELIG
        MOVE WS-INCONS-CNT TO MB-INCONSISTENT
        MOVE "DRY" TO MB-RUN-STATUS
        MOVE "MED BATCH DRY RUN" TO MB-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM LOCK-RUN
    IF MB-RC NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM SCAN-PASS
    IF MB-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM UNLOCK-RUN
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM RUN-BEGIN
    IF MB-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM UNLOCK-RUN
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF MB-REPLAY = "Y"
        MOVE "MED BATCH ALREADY COMPLETED" TO MB-MSG
        PERFORM RUN-EXPORT
        PERFORM UNLOCK-RUN
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-SCAN-CNT TO MBR-SCANNED OF RUN-REC
    MOVE WS-ELIG-CASES TO MBR-ELIGIBLE OF RUN-REC
    MOVE WS-ELIG-EXP TO MBR-EXPIRE-ELIG OF RUN-REC
    MOVE WS-ELIG-RCV TO MBR-RECOVER-ELIG OF RUN-REC
    MOVE WS-ELIG-RCN TO MBR-RECON-ELIG OF RUN-REC
    PERFORM PROCESS-PASS
    IF MB-RC = "00"
        PERFORM RUN-FINISH
    ELSE
        MOVE "RUNNING" TO MBR-STATUS OF RUN-REC
        MOVE WS-PROCESSED TO MBR-PROCESSED OF RUN-REC
        MOVE WS-INCONS-CNT TO MBR-INCONSISTENT OF RUN-REC
        MOVE WS-EXC-CNT TO MBR-EXCEPTIONS OF RUN-REC
        PERFORM RUN-STORE
    END-IF
    PERFORM RUN-EXPORT
    PERFORM RUN-AUDIT
    PERFORM UNLOCK-RUN
    GOBACK.

LOCK-RUN.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LOCK-NAME
    STRING "MEDB-" DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(MB-REQ-ID)
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-LOCK-NAME
    END-STRING
    MOVE MB-OPERATOR TO WS-LOCK-OWNER
    MOVE "A" TO WS-LOCK-MODE
    CALL "BLCK" USING WS-LOCK-NAME WS-LOCK-OWNER WS-LOCK-MODE
        WS-LOCK-ST
    IF WS-LOCK-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "24" TO MB-RC
        MOVE "MED BATCH ALREADY RUNNING" TO MB-MSG
    END-IF.

UNLOCK-RUN.
    MOVE "R" TO WS-LOCK-MODE
    CALL "BLCK" USING WS-LOCK-NAME WS-LOCK-OWNER WS-LOCK-MODE
        WS-LOCK-ST.

BUILD-REQ-ID.
    IF MB-REQ-ID NOT = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO MB-REQ-ID
    IF WS-SCOPE = SPACES
        STRING "MED-BATCH-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-BIZDATE DELIMITED SIZE
            INTO MB-REQ-ID
        END-STRING
    ELSE
        STRING "MED-BATCH-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-BIZDATE
            DELIMITED SIZE "-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-SCOPE
            DELIMITED SIZE INTO MB-REQ-ID
        END-STRING
    END-IF.

RUN-BEGIN.
    OPEN I-O RUN-FILE
    IF WS-RUN-ST = "35"
        OPEN OUTPUT RUN-FILE
        CLOSE RUN-FILE
        OPEN I-O RUN-FILE
    END-IF
    IF WS-RUN-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
        MOVE "MED BATCH RUN STORE UNAVAILABLE" TO MB-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO RUN-REC
    MOVE MB-REQ-ID TO MBR-REQ-ID OF RUN-REC
    READ RUN-FILE
    EVALUATE WS-RUN-ST
        WHEN "00"
            IF MBR-STATUS OF RUN-REC = "COMPLETED"
                MOVE "Y" TO MB-REPLAY
            ELSE
                MOVE "RUNNING" TO MBR-STATUS OF RUN-REC
            END-IF
        WHEN "23"
            PERFORM NEW-RUN
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
            MOVE "MED BATCH RUN READ ERROR" TO MB-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE RUN-FILE.

NEW-RUN.
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO MBR-BIZDATE OF RUN-REC
    MOVE "RUNNING" TO MBR-STATUS OF RUN-REC
    MOVE MB-OPERATOR TO MBR-OPERATOR OF RUN-REC
    MOVE MB-CORR TO MBR-CORR OF RUN-REC
    MOVE MB-SIM TO MBR-SIM OF RUN-REC
    MOVE 0 TO MBR-SCANNED OF RUN-REC MBR-ELIGIBLE OF RUN-REC
        MBR-EXPIRE-ELIG OF RUN-REC MBR-RECOVER-ELIG OF RUN-REC
        MBR-RECON-ELIG OF RUN-REC MBR-PROCESSED OF RUN-REC
        MBR-EXPIRED OF RUN-REC MBR-RETRIED OF RUN-REC
        MBR-REFRESHED OF RUN-REC MBR-SKIPPED OF RUN-REC
        MBR-RETRY-REQ OF RUN-REC MBR-FAILED OF RUN-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO MBR-LAST-CASE OF RUN-REC
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO MBR-STARTED OF RUN-REC
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO MBR-UPDATED OF RUN-REC
    MOVE 0 TO MBR-COMPLETED OF RUN-REC
    WRITE RUN-REC
    IF WS-RUN-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
        MOVE "MED BATCH RUN WRITE ERROR" TO MB-MSG
    END-IF.

RUN-STORE.
    MOVE MB-REQ-ID TO MBR-REQ-ID OF RUN-REC
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO MBR-UPDATED OF RUN-REC
    OPEN I-O RUN-FILE
    IF WS-RUN-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
        STRING "MED BATCH RUN SAVE UNAVAILABLE st="
            DELIMITED SIZE WS-RUN-ST INTO MB-MSG
        END-STRING
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    DELETE RUN-FILE RECORD
    IF WS-RUN-ST NOT = "00" AND WS-RUN-ST NOT = "23"
        CLOSE RUN-FILE
        MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
        STRING "MED BATCH RUN DELETE ERROR st=" DELIMITED SIZE
            WS-RUN-ST INTO MB-MSG
        END-STRING
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE "00" TO WS-RUN-ST
    WRITE RUN-REC
    IF WS-RUN-ST NOT = "00"
        CLOSE RUN-FILE
        MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
        STRING "MED BATCH RUN WRITE ERROR st=" DELIMITED SIZE
            WS-RUN-ST INTO MB-MSG
        END-STRING
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    CLOSE RUN-FILE.

RUN-READ.
    OPEN INPUT RUN-FILE
    IF WS-RUN-ST = "35"
        MOVE "23" TO MB-RC
        MOVE "MED BATCH RUN NOT FOUND" TO MB-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF WS-RUN-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
        MOVE "MED BATCH RUN STORE UNAVAILABLE" TO MB-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO RUN-REC
    MOVE MB-REQ-ID TO MBR-REQ-ID OF RUN-REC
    READ RUN-FILE
    EVALUATE WS-RUN-ST
        WHEN "00"
            MOVE "00" TO MB-RC
            MOVE "MED BATCH RUN" TO MB-MSG
            PERFORM RUN-EXPORT
        WHEN "23"
            MOVE "23" TO MB-RC
            MOVE "MED BATCH RUN NOT FOUND" TO MB-MSG
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
            MOVE "MED BATCH RUN READ ERROR" TO MB-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE RUN-FILE.

RUN-EXPORT.
    MOVE MBR-BIZDATE OF RUN-REC TO MB-BIZDATE
    MOVE MBR-STATUS OF RUN-REC TO MB-RUN-STATUS
    MOVE MBR-SCANNED OF RUN-REC TO MB-SCANNED
    MOVE MBR-ELIGIBLE OF RUN-REC TO MB-ELIGIBLE
    MOVE MBR-EXPIRE-ELIG OF RUN-REC TO MB-EXPIRE-ELIG
    MOVE MBR-RECOVER-ELIG OF RUN-REC TO MB-RECOVER-ELIG
    MOVE MBR-RECON-ELIG OF RUN-REC TO MB-RECON-ELIG
    MOVE MBR-PROCESSED OF RUN-REC TO MB-PROCESSED
    MOVE MBR-EXPIRED OF RUN-REC TO MB-EXPIRED
    MOVE MBR-RETRIED OF RUN-REC TO MB-RETRIED
    MOVE MBR-REFRESHED OF RUN-REC TO MB-REFRESHED
    MOVE MBR-SKIPPED OF RUN-REC TO MB-SKIPPED
    MOVE MBR-RETRY-REQ OF RUN-REC TO MB-RETRY-REQ
    MOVE MBR-INCONSISTENT OF RUN-REC TO MB-INCONSISTENT
    MOVE MBR-EXCEPTIONS OF RUN-REC TO MB-EXCEPTIONS
    MOVE MBR-FAILED OF RUN-REC TO MB-FAILED
    MOVE MBR-LAST-CASE OF RUN-REC TO MB-LAST-CASE.

SCAN-PASS.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-SCAN-CNT WS-ELIG-CASES WS-ELIG-EXP WS-ELIG-RCV
        WS-ELIG-RCN WS-INCONS-CNT WS-EXC-CNT
    OPEN INPUT SCAN-FILE
    IF WS-SCAN-ST = "35"
        MOVE "00" TO WS-SCAN-ST
        MOVE "00" TO MB-RC
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-SCAN-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
        MOVE "MED STORE UNAVAILABLE" TO MB-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ SCAN-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM DISPOSITION
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE SCAN-FILE.

DISPOSITION.
    MOVE "NONE" TO MB-ELIG-CLASS
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-INCONS
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-WORK-OP
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-DESIRED
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-DEV-POST
    MOVE "N" TO WS-DEV-FOUND
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-DEV-STATE
    IF WS-SCOPE NOT = SPACES AND
       MC-CLAIMANT OF SCAN-REC(1:WS-SCOPE-LEN) NOT =
       WS-SCOPE(1:WS-SCOPE-LEN)
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    ADD 1 TO WS-SCAN-CNT
    MOVE MC-STATUS OF SCAN-REC TO WS-STATE
    MOVE MC-DEADLINE OF SCAN-REC TO WS-DEADLINE
    MOVE MC-DEVOL-PIX-ID OF SCAN-REC TO WS-DEVOL-ID
    MOVE MC-RECON-STATUS OF SCAN-REC TO WS-RECON-CUR
    EVALUATE WS-STATE
        WHEN "OPEN"
        WHEN "IN-ANALYSIS"
        WHEN "BLOCK-PEND"
        WHEN "BLOCKED"
        WHEN "DECIDE-PEND"
            IF WS-DEADLINE NOT = 0 AND WS-BIZDATE >= WS-DEADLINE
                MOVE "EXPIRE" TO MB-ELIG-CLASS
                MOVE "MED-EXPIRE" TO WS-WORK-OP
            END-IF
        WHEN "DEVOL-PEND"
        WHEN "DEVOLV-UNK"
            MOVE "RECOVER" TO MB-ELIG-CLASS
            MOVE "MED-EXECUTE" TO WS-WORK-OP
            IF WS-DEVOL-ID = SPACES
                MOVE "LOST" TO WS-DEV-POST
                MOVE "DEVMISSING" TO WS-INCONS
            END-IF
        WHEN "DEVOLVED"
        WHEN "PART-DEVOLV"
        WHEN "CLOSED"
            PERFORM RECON-DISPOSITION
        WHEN OTHER
            CONTINUE
    END-EVALUATE
    IF MB-ELIG-CLASS NOT = "NONE"
        ADD 1 TO WS-ELIG-CASES
        EVALUATE MB-ELIG-CLASS
            WHEN "EXPIRE" ADD 1 TO WS-ELIG-EXP
            WHEN "RECOVER" ADD 1 TO WS-ELIG-RCV
            WHEN "RECON" ADD 1 TO WS-ELIG-RCN
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF
    IF WS-INCONS NOT = SPACES
        ADD 1 TO WS-INCONS-CNT
    END-IF.

RECON-DISPOSITION.
    IF WS-RECON-CUR = "MATCHED" OR WS-RECON-CUR = "UNMATCHED"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-DEVOL-ID = SPACES
        IF WS-STATE = "DEVOLVED" OR WS-STATE = "PART-DEVOLV"
            MOVE "DEVMISSING" TO WS-INCONS
        END-IF
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM READ-DEVOLUTION
    IF WS-DEV-FOUND NOT = "Y"
        MOVE "LINKBROKEN" TO WS-INCONS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-DEV-POST NOT = "POSTED"
        MOVE "PENDING" TO WS-DESIRED
    ELSE
        IF WS-DEV-STATE = "RECONCILED"
            MOVE "RECONCILED" TO WS-DESIRED
        ELSE
            IF WS-DEV-STATE = "SETTLED"
                MOVE "SETTLED" TO WS-DESIRED
            ELSE
                MOVE "POSTED" TO WS-DESIRED
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF
    IF WS-DESIRED NOT = SPACES AND
       WS-DESIRED NOT = MC-RECON-STATUS OF SCAN-REC
        MOVE "RECON" TO MB-ELIG-CLASS
        MOVE "MED-RECON" TO WS-WORK-OP
    END-IF.

READ-DEVOLUTION.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-PX-STO-REQ
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-PX-REC
    MOVE WS-DEVOL-ID TO PX-ID OF BK-PX-REC
    MOVE "GET" TO XS-OP
    CALL "BPXSTO" USING BK-PX-STO-REQ BK-PX-REC
    IF XS-RC = "00"
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-DEV-FOUND
        MOVE PX-STATUS OF BK-PX-REC TO WS-DEV-STATE
        MOVE PX-POST-STATUS OF BK-PX-REC TO WS-DEV-POST
    ELSE
        MOVE "N" TO WS-DEV-FOUND
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-DEV-POST
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-DEV-STATE
    END-IF.

PROCESS-PASS.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-PROCESSED WS-INCONS-CNT WS-EXC-CNT
    OPEN INPUT SCAN-FILE
    IF WS-SCAN-ST = "35"
        MOVE "00" TO WS-SCAN-ST
        MOVE "00" TO MB-RC
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-SCAN-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO MB-RC
        MOVE "MED STORE UNAVAILABLE" TO MB-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y" OR WS-STOP = "Y"
        READ SCAN-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM PROCESS-CASE
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE SCAN-FILE.

PROCESS-CASE.
    PERFORM DISPOSITION
    MOVE WS-INCONS TO WS-INCONS-PREV
    IF MB-ELIG-CLASS = "NONE"
        IF WS-INCONS NOT = SPACES
            MOVE MC-STATUS OF SCAN-REC TO WS-PREV
            MOVE MC-CASE-ID OF SCAN-REC TO MB-CASE-ID
            MOVE MC-CLAIMED-AMT OF SCAN-REC TO WS-CLAIM-AMT
            MOVE MC-CURRENCY OF SCAN-REC TO WS-CLAIM-CUR
            PERFORM EMIT-EXCEPTION
            MOVE WS-INCONS TO WS-CLASS
            PERFORM AUDIT-CASE
            MOVE WS-INCONS-CNT TO MBR-INCONSISTENT OF RUN-REC
            MOVE WS-EXC-CNT TO MBR-EXCEPTIONS OF RUN-REC
            MOVE MC-CASE-ID OF SCAN-REC TO MBR-LAST-CASE
                                                 OF RUN-REC
            PERFORM RUN-STORE
        END-IF
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF MBR-LAST-CASE OF RUN-REC NOT = SPACES AND
       MC-CASE-ID OF SCAN-REC <= MBR-LAST-CASE OF RUN-REC
        ADD 1 TO MBR-SKIPPED OF RUN-REC
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE MC-STATUS OF SCAN-REC TO WS-PREV
    MOVE MC-CASE-ID OF SCAN-REC TO MB-CASE-ID
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-MC-PARMS
    MOVE WS-WORK-OP TO MP-OP
    MOVE MC-CASE-ID OF SCAN-REC TO MP-REQ-CASE-ID
    MOVE MB-OPERATOR TO MP-OPERATOR
    MOVE MB-REQ-ID TO MP-CORR
    MOVE MB-SIM TO MP-SIM
    IF MB-ELIG-CLASS = "RECON"
        MOVE WS-DESIRED TO MP-RECON-STATUS
    END-IF
    CALL "BPXMED" USING BK-MC-PARMS
    MOVE MP-RC TO WS-ENG-RC
    IF WS-ENG-RC NOT = "00" AND WS-ENG-RC NOT = "20" AND
       WS-ENG-RC NOT = "24"
        MOVE WS-ENG-RC TO MB-RC
        MOVE MP-MSG TO MB-MSG
        ADD 1 TO MBR-FAILED OF RUN-REC
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-STOP
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM CLASSIFY-CASE
    PERFORM AUDIT-CASE
    ADD 1 TO WS-PROCESSED
    MOVE WS-PROCESSED TO MBR-PROCESSED OF RUN-REC
    MOVE WS-INCONS-CNT TO MBR-INCONSISTENT OF RUN-REC
    MOVE WS-EXC-CNT TO MBR-EXCEPTIONS OF RUN-REC
    MOVE MC-CASE-ID OF SCAN-REC TO MBR-LAST-CASE OF RUN-REC
    PERFORM RUN-STORE
    IF MB-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-STOP
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF MB-FAULT-AFTER NOT = 0 AND WS-PROCESSED >= MB-FAULT-AFTER
        MOVE "24" TO MB-RC
        MOVE "MED BATCH FAULT STOP" TO MB-MSG
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-STOP
    END-IF.

CLASSIFY-CASE.
    MOVE "NO-CHANGE" TO WS-CLASS
    MOVE MC-CLAIMED-AMT OF SCAN-REC TO WS-CLAIM-AMT
    MOVE MC-CURRENCY OF SCAN-REC TO WS-CLAIM-CUR
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-PX-MC-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-MC-STO-REQ
    MOVE MC-CASE-ID OF SCAN-REC TO MC-SO-CASE-ID
    MOVE "GET" TO MC-SO-OP
    CALL "BPXMSTO" USING BK-MC-STO-REQ BK-PX-MC-REC
    IF MC-SO-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "CASE-MISSING" TO WS-CLASS
        MOVE WS-CLASS TO MB-CLASS
        MOVE "CASE-MISSING" TO WS-INCONS
        PERFORM EMIT-EXCEPTION
        ADD 1 TO MBR-FAILED OF RUN-REC
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE MC-STATUS OF BK-PX-MC-REC TO WS-STATE
    MOVE MC-DEVOL-PIX-ID OF BK-PX-MC-REC TO WS-DEVOL-ID
    EVALUATE MB-ELIG-CLASS
        WHEN "EXPIRE"
            IF WS-STATE = "EXPIRED"
                MOVE "EXPIRED" TO WS-CLASS
                ADD 1 TO MBR-EXPIRED OF RUN-REC
            ELSE
                ADD 1 TO MBR-SKIPPED OF RUN-REC
            END-IF
        WHEN "RECOVER"
            PERFORM CLASSIFY-RECOVER
        WHEN "RECON"
            PERFORM CLASSIFY-RECON
        WHEN OTHER
            CONTINUE
    END-EVALUATE
    MOVE WS-CLASS TO MB-CLASS
    IF WS-CLASS = "RETRY-REQ"
        IF WS-DEVOL-ID = SPACES
            MOVE "DEVMISSING" TO WS-INCONS
        ELSE
            IF WS-DEV-FOUND NOT = "Y"
                MOVE "LINKBROKEN" TO WS-INCONS
            ELSE
                MOVE "MEDRETRY" TO WS-INCONS
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF
    IF WS-INCONS NOT = SPACES
        IF WS-INCONS NOT = WS-INCONS-PREV
            ADD 1 TO WS-INCONS-CNT
        END-IF
        PERFORM EMIT-EXCEPTION
    END-IF.

CLASSIFY-RECOVER.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-DEV-POST
    MOVE "N" TO WS-DEV-FOUND
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-DEV-STATE
    IF WS-DEVOL-ID NOT = SPACES
        PERFORM READ-DEVOLUTION
    END-IF
    IF WS-STATE = "DEVOLVED" OR WS-STATE = "PART-DEVOLV"
        IF WS-DEV-POST = "POSTED"
            MOVE "DEVOLVED" TO WS-CLASS
            ADD 1 TO MBR-RETRIED OF RUN-REC
        ELSE
            MOVE "RETRY-REQ" TO WS-CLASS
            ADD 1 TO MBR-RETRY-REQ OF RUN-REC
        END-IF
    ELSE
        IF WS-STATE = "DEVOL-PEND" OR WS-STATE = "DEVOLV-UNK"
            MOVE "RETRY-REQ" TO WS-CLASS
            ADD 1 TO MBR-RETRY-REQ OF RUN-REC
        ELSE
            ADD 1 TO MBR-SKIPPED OF RUN-REC
        END-IF
    END-IF.

CLASSIFY-RECON.
    IF WS-DEV-FOUND NOT = "Y"
        MOVE "LINKBROKEN" TO WS-INCONS
    END-IF
    IF WS-STATE = "DEVOLVED" OR WS-STATE = "PART-DEVOLV" OR
       WS-STATE = "CLOSED"
        IF WS-DEV-FOUND NOT = "Y"
            MOVE "RETRY-REQ" TO WS-CLASS
            ADD 1 TO MBR-RETRY-REQ OF RUN-REC
        ELSE
            MOVE "RECON-OK" TO WS-CLASS
            ADD 1 TO MBR-REFRESHED OF RUN-REC
        END-IF
    ELSE
        ADD 1 TO MBR-SKIPPED OF RUN-REC
    END-IF.

AUDIT-CASE.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE MB-OPERATOR TO BK-AUD-OPERATOR
    MOVE "MED-BATCH" TO BK-AUD-ACTION
    MOVE MB-CASE-ID TO BK-AUD-ENTITY
    MOVE MB-REQ-ID TO BK-AUD-CORR
    MOVE WS-PREV TO BK-AUD-BEFORE
    MOVE WS-STATE TO BK-AUD-AFTER
    IF WS-INCONS NOT = SPACES
        MOVE WS-INCONS TO BK-AUD-RESULT
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-ENG-RC TO BK-AUD-RESULT
    END-IF
    CALL "BAUD" USING BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-EVT-PARMS
    MOVE "PIX.MED.BATCH.CASE.v1" TO BK-EVT-TYPE
    MOVE MB-CASE-ID TO BK-EVT-KEY
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-EVT-PAYLOAD
    IF WS-INCONS NOT = SPACES AND
       EXC-ID OF BK-EXC-REC NOT = SPACES
        STRING FUNCTION TRIM(MB-CASE-ID) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
            DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-PREV) DELIMITED SIZE
            "|" DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-STATE)
            DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
            FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CLASS) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
            DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(MB-REQ-ID)
            DELIMITED SIZE "|EXC=" DELIMITED SIZE
            FUNCTION TRIM(EXC-ID OF BK-EXC-REC) DELIMITED SIZE
            INTO BK-EVT-PAYLOAD
        END-STRING
    ELSE
        STRING FUNCTION TRIM(MB-CASE-ID) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
            DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-PREV) DELIMITED SIZE
            "|" DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-STATE)
            DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
            FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CLASS) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
            DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(MB-REQ-ID)
            DELIMITED SIZE INTO BK-EVT-PAYLOAD
        END-STRING
    END-IF
    CALL "BEVT" USING BK-EVT-PARMS.

EMIT-EXCEPTION.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-EXC-REC
    CALL "BSEQ" USING WS-SEQ-NAME WS-SEQ WS-SEQ-ST
    IF WS-SEQ-ST NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-SEQ TO WS-ID-NUM
    MOVE WS-ID-NUM TO WS-ID-ED
    STRING "E" DELIMITED SIZE WS-ID-ED DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO EXC-ID OF BK-EXC-REC
    END-STRING
    MOVE MB-REQ-ID(1:20) TO EXC-RUN-ID OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE "PIXMED" TO EXC-TYPE OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE WS-INCONS TO EXC-CODE OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE "OPEN" TO EXC-STATUS OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE MB-CASE-ID TO EXC-KEY OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE MC-ORIG-PIX-ID OF SCAN-REC TO EXC-SRC-REF OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE WS-DEVOL-ID TO EXC-INT-REF OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE WS-CLAIM-AMT TO EXC-AMOUNT OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE WS-CLAIM-CUR TO EXC-CURRENCY OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO EXC-BIZDATE OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO EXC-REASON OF BK-EXC-REC
    STRING "MED BATCH: CASE=" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(MB-CASE-ID) DELIMITED SIZE
        " CODE=" DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-INCONS)
        DELIMITED SIZE " RUN=" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(MB-REQ-ID) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO EXC-REASON OF BK-EXC-REC
    END-STRING
    MOVE MB-OPERATOR TO EXC-OPERATOR OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO EXC-CREATED OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO EXC-UPDATED OF BK-EXC-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-REC-PARMS
    MOVE "WRITE" TO RP-OP
    CALL "BRECESO" USING BK-REC-PARMS BK-EXC-REC
    IF RP-RC = "00" OR RP-RC = "22"
        ADD 1 TO WS-EXC-CNT
    END-IF.

RUN-FINISH.
    MOVE "COMPLETED" TO MBR-STATUS OF RUN-REC
    MOVE WS-PROCESSED TO MBR-PROCESSED OF RUN-REC
    MOVE WS-INCONS-CNT TO MBR-INCONSISTENT OF RUN-REC
    MOVE WS-EXC-CNT TO MBR-EXCEPTIONS OF RUN-REC
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO MBR-COMPLETED OF RUN-REC
    PERFORM RUN-STORE.

RUN-AUDIT.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE MB-OPERATOR TO BK-AUD-OPERATOR
    MOVE "MED-BATRUN" TO BK-AUD-ACTION
    MOVE MB-REQ-ID TO BK-AUD-ENTITY
    MOVE MB-CORR TO BK-AUD-CORR
    MOVE MBR-STATUS OF RUN-REC TO BK-AUD-BEFORE
    MOVE MBR-STATUS OF RUN-REC TO BK-AUD-AFTER
    MOVE MB-RC TO BK-AUD-RESULT
    CALL "BAUD" USING BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-EVT-PARMS
    MOVE "PIX.MED.BATCH.RUN.v1" TO BK-EVT-TYPE
    MOVE MB-REQ-ID TO BK-EVT-KEY
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-EVT-PAYLOAD
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(MB-REQ-ID) DELIMITED SIZE "|STATUS="
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(MBR-STATUS OF RUN-REC)
        DELIMITED SIZE "|SCANNED=" DELIMITED SIZE
        MBR-SCANNED OF RUN-REC DELIMITED SIZE "|ELIGIBLE="
        DELIMITED SIZE MBR-ELIGIBLE OF RUN-REC DELIMITED SIZE
        "|EXPIRE-ELIG=" DELIMITED SIZE
        MBR-EXPIRE-ELIG OF RUN-REC DELIMITED SIZE
        "|RECOVER-ELIG=" DELIMITED SIZE
        MBR-RECOVER-ELIG OF RUN-REC DELIMITED SIZE
        "|RECON-ELIG=" DELIMITED SIZE
        MBR-RECON-ELIG OF RUN-REC DELIMITED SIZE
        "|PROCESSED=" DELIMITED SIZE MBR-PROCESSED OF RUN-REC
        DELIMITED SIZE "|EXPIRED=" DELIMITED SIZE
        MBR-EXPIRED OF RUN-REC DELIMITED SIZE "|RETRIED="
        DELIMITED SIZE MBR-RETRIED OF RUN-REC DELIMITED SIZE
        "|REFRESHED=" DELIMITED SIZE MBR-REFRESHED OF RUN-REC
        DELIMITED SIZE "|RETRY-REQ=" DELIMITED SIZE
        MBR-RETRY-REQ OF RUN-REC DELIMITED SIZE "|SKIPPED="
        DELIMITED SIZE MBR-SKIPPED OF RUN-REC DELIMITED SIZE
        "|FAILED=" DELIMITED SIZE MBR-FAILED OF RUN-REC
        DELIMITED SIZE "|INCONSISTENT=" DELIMITED SIZE
        MBR-INCONSISTENT OF RUN-REC DELIMITED SIZE
        "|EXCEPTIONS=" DELIMITED SIZE MBR-EXCEPTIONS OF RUN-REC
        DELIMITED SIZE "|LAST=" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(MBR-LAST-CASE OF RUN-REC) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO BK-EVT-PAYLOAD
    END-STRING
    CALL "BEVT" USING BK-EVT-PARMS.

END PROGRAM BPXMEOD.
